# The scopehal-apps `lib` submodule (the scopehal fork carrying the SLogic
# driver) is supplied from the repo's own `sources/scopehal` submodule and
# overlaid onto the wrapper's `lib` at build time by each target driver
# (override_ngscopeclient_lib). The fork's pin lives in the superproject as the
# sources/scopehal gitlink — bump it with `git -C sources/scopehal checkout <rev>`
# — not here; there is no build-time network fetch of the fork any more.
#
# This file lives under build/common/, hashed into SLOGIC_BUILD_LOGIC_KEY.
# Only the submodule PATH inside scopehal-apps remains configurable here.
LIB_SUBMODULE="lib"
